# Review gate for the files with the widest blast radius.
#
# claude-code/ is symlinked into ~/.claude by setup.sh, so a change to any
# path below reaches every session in every project on the next start —
# there is no staging environment between this repo and a working agent.
# Everything else in the repo is reviewed normally.

/claude-code/AGENTS.md      @rdevitto86
/claude-code/settings.json  @rdevitto86
/claude-code/hooks/         @rdevitto86
